    <div class="stage-copy">
      <h2>Why this matters when you are <em>moving an older person</em></h2>
      <p class="stage-intro">A later-life move means people coming into a home that has often been lived in for decades, and handling belongings that matter deeply. It is reasonable to ask who is coming, how they have been checked and what happens if something goes wrong. This page sets out our answers plainly.</p>
      <div class="svc-grid">
        {% if site.trust.dbsCheckedStaff %}
        <div class="svc-card wide">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i></span>
          <h3 class="svc-name">DBS-checked staff</h3>
          <p class="svc-desc">The people who work in clients&rsquo; homes for Chayce are DBS-checked{% if site.trust.dbsLevel %} to {{ site.trust.dbsLevel }} level{% if site.trust.dbsBarredList %}, including the barred list check{% endif %}{% endif %}. A DBS check is a criminal record check carried out through the Disclosure and Barring Service, which covers England and Wales. That covers the team doing packing, removals and downsizing support for older people. We work with our own vetted team rather than outsourcing your move to unknown subcontractors.</p>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-boxes"></i></span>
          <h3 class="svc-name">Insurance</h3>
          <p class="svc-desc">Every removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit. Chayce holds goods in transit insurance and public liability insurance. The details are set out in the service agreement before the move begins, so you can read them before you commit. See our <a href="/terms-of-service/">terms of service</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart"></i></span>
          <h3 class="svc-name">Supporting older and vulnerable clients</h3>
          <p class="svc-desc">Many of the people we help are older, and some are being helped by a son, daughter or other family member. If someone else holds a Lasting Power of Attorney or is helping to make decisions, please tell us at the start so that decisions are made by the right person. Our <a href="/blog/lasting-power-of-attorney-moving-a-parent/">guide to Lasting Power of Attorney and moving a parent</a> explains the basics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-comments"></i></span>
          <h3 class="svc-name">If something goes wrong</h3>
          <p class="svc-desc">If you are unhappy with any part of your move, tell us as soon as you can by phone on <a href="tel:+447708925432">{{ site.telephoneDisplay }}</a> or by email at {{ site.email }}.{% if site.trust.complaintsResponseDays %} We will acknowledge your complaint within {{ site.trust.complaintsResponseDays }} working days.{% endif %} We will look into what happened and tell you what we will do about it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i></span>
          <h3 class="svc-name">Your information</h3>
          <p class="svc-desc">We only use your personal information to plan and carry out your move. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> for exactly what we collect, why, and your rights.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="svc-card wide">
          <span class="svc-icon"><i class="fas fa-building"></i></span>
          <h3 class="svc-name">Company details</h3>
          <p class="svc-desc">{{ site.legalName }}, company number {{ site.companiesHouseNumber }}, registered in {{ site.registeredCountry }}. Registered office and office: Unit F2B Barratt House, Kingsthorpe Road, Northampton NN2 6EZ, open {{ site.openingHoursText }}.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Are Chayce&rsquo;s staff DBS-checked?</summary><p>Yes. The people who work in clients&rsquo; homes for Chayce are DBS-checked to Enhanced level, including the barred list check. A DBS check is a criminal record check carried out through the Disclosure and Barring Service, which covers England and Wales.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is my move insured?</summary><p>Every removal is fully insured against loss or damage in transit. Chayce holds goods in transit insurance and public liability insurance, with details set out in the service agreement before the move begins.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can a family member arrange a move on behalf of a parent?</summary><p>Yes, many of our clients are helped by their children. If someone holds a Lasting Power of Attorney or is helping to make decisions, please tell us at the start so that decisions are made by the right person.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I make a complaint?</summary><p>Tell us as soon as you can by phone on 07708 925432 or by email at info@chayceproperties.com. We will look into what happened and tell you what we will do about it.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

